{"type":"standard","title":"Juan Ciscomani","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Juan Ciscomani</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q115220916","titles":{"canonical":"Juan_Ciscomani","normalized":"Juan Ciscomani","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Juan Ciscomani</span></span>"},"pageid":71976915,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Rep._Juan_Ciscomani_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Juan_Ciscomani_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/Rep._Juan_Ciscomani_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374611948","tid":"d2c26f9a-af1f-11f1-8bd3-d7c64d4a0149","timestamp":"2026-09-13T03:04:24Z","description":"American politician (born 1982)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Ciscomani","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Ciscomani?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Ciscomani?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Juan_Ciscomani"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Ciscomani","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Juan_Ciscomani","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Ciscomani?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Juan_Ciscomani"}},"extract":"Juan Ciscomani III is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Arizona's 6th congressional district since 2023. A Republican, he was a senior adviser to former Governor Doug Ducey and vice chair of the Arizona-Mexico Commission. Ciscomani was chosen to deliver the Republican response to the 2023 State of the Union Address in Spanish.","extract_html":"<p><b>Juan Ciscomani III</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for Arizona's 6th congressional district since 2023. A Republican, he was a senior adviser to former Governor Doug Ducey and vice chair of the Arizona-Mexico Commission. Ciscomani was chosen to deliver the Republican response to the 2023 State of the Union Address in Spanish.</p>"}